# Summary

The agreement's allocation rule for plots is: "Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement." [[cite:obs-4d6b2807cc832ea006084f1200726686f3f6f0b7 "Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement."]]

The agreement does not specify the size of a plot. [[cite:obs-4d6b2807cc832ea006084f1200726686f3f6f0b7 "# Garden agreement

## Plots

Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement."]]
